{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Title.png?t=1750545167\" /></div>In 'Chosen of God', you take on the role of the young shepherd David, destined to become King. In a world filled with danger and challenges, you must face formidable enemies, from giants to entire armies, using your combat skills and strategy to prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a dynamic and thrilling gameplay experience, combining hack-and-slash elements with RPG mechanics. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main features:</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Dynamic_and_Varied_Combat.png?t=1750545167\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Chosen_of_God_Combat.gif?t=1750545167\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fluid Combat</strong>: Execute devastating combos, dodge enemy attacks, perform parries, and block blows with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aerial Dominance</strong>: Launch your enemies into the air and continue the fight mid-air.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/CHARACTER_AND_EQUIPMENT_EVOLUTION.png?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/equipamiento-gif.gif?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Constant Ascent</strong>: Improve your attributes and skills to become an unstoppable warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customizable Arsenal</strong>: Unlock new weapons and upgrade existing ones to adapt to any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Interactive_World_and_Exploration.png?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/World.gif?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome Obstacles</strong>: Climb cliffs, jump chasms, swim, and overcome any obstacle in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover and Conquer</strong>: Collect valuable items and interact with the environment to uncover great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vases and Urns</strong>: By breaking vases, urns, or other fragile objects, players can find coins, gems, potions, or even keys that unlock secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/DISTINCTIVE_MECHANICS.png?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Habilidades-Especiales.gif?t=1750545167\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power of the Anointed</strong>: Unleash the power of the anointed and dominate the battlefield with time on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Liberation and Justice</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue innocent prisoners and free the oppressed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recover stolen livestock and treasures.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faith and Devotion</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy pagan idols and purify the land. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect God's altars.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special abilities</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Devastating Arrow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrow Flurry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whirlwind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coup de Gr\u00e2ce</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divine Judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Downward Strike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mass</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317930?t=1750545167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3317930?t=1750545167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/e23ba8ee6660932eae6fb65e7cda229bf5891f9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750545167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/e23ba8ee6660932eae6fb65e7cda229bf5891f9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750545167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317930/extras/Title.png?t=1750545167\" /></div>In 'Chosen of God', you take on the role of the young shepherd David, destined to become King. In a world filled with danger and challenges, you must face formidable enemies, from giants to entire armies, using your combat skills and strategy to prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a dy